      View a list of worker nodes by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get nodes -l node-role.kubernetes.io/worker"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Select a node from the list and display its memory usage by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc debug node/<selected_node> -- free -m"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>Replace <code>&lt;selected_node&gt;</code> with the node name.</p>
      <p>If swap is provisioned, an amount greater than zero is displayed in the <code>Swap:</code> row.</p>
